# The guarded base updates must lose to a concurrent writer instead of
# overwriting it. This Git wrapper moves refs/heads/main to RACE_OID just
# before cleanup's own update-ref of it, or, for a fast-forward in the base
# worktree, moves it and then fails the merge.
